We choose two mochi, say with sizes $a$ and $b$. We can place one on top of the other to form a kagamimochi if the condition is met.
The problem statement says: "Given two mochi A and B, with sizes a and b respectively, you can make one kagamimochi by placing mochi A on top of mochi B if and only if a is at most half of b."
